  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/sJcvkhDc/images/ffa7bc514f15281edf7e1b1462cabaef0d40c11e.png\" alt=\"神祕村莊\" width=\"574\" height=\"314\"></p><hr><h4>蒼白花園生態域有了生機。樹林間潛伏著各種奇異又神祕的建築。</h4><h4>如果你在它們周圍刷拭可疑的礫石，也許會發現答案……尤其是在夜間。看來你四周的森林會獎勵勇敢的人……</h4><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/Xq1JfTc9/optimized.gif\" alt=\"日夜戰利品變化的GIF\" width=\"473\" height=\"475\"></p><hr><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">目前有&nbsp;<strong>12</strong> 個建築物，共 <strong>26</strong> 種獨特的變體。請在圖庫中查看更多範例。</h4><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/sJcvkhDc/images/a5e0131c8034021c6221061b7ca2ce3e90dd2797.png\" alt=\"水坑\" width=\"602\" height=\"339\"></p><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fshop.purehosted.net%252faff%252fwabi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1124622/description_123d7cb0-72af-4cd0-9d62-731bd74bc3cf.png\" alt=\"purehosted伺服器10%折扣，自訂蒼白組件\" width=\"600\" height=\"100\"></a></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\">看看我們的其他模組：</span></span></strong></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/wabi-sabi-structures-datapack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1EiT59N.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"580\" height=\"116\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">Wabi-Sabi 建築結構</span></span></a></strong></span></h4><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/revamped-shipwrecks-datapack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1098920/description_0fb5046e-db7e-4520-a019-11a6b8af5fd2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#0a26ae\"><strong><a style=\"color:#0a26ae\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/revamped-shipwrecks-datapack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">翻新船骸</span></a></strong></span></h4><hr><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><strong><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unwrecked-ships-datapack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/534/260/2022-12-04_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">完好船隻</span></a></strong></span></h4><p>&nbsp;</p>",
